  "description": "The META SX V5 RACE will delight ROCKSHOX fans.\n• This ROCKSHOX Zeb Ultimate fork is equipped with a DebonAir + spring, ButterCups technology, and decompression valves. On the back we use the Super Deluxe Ultimate shock with its high and low speed compression settings and the configurable hydraulic stop for jumps. The behaviour of the suspension can also be adjusted by playing on the negative and positive air volumes.\n• The TRP DH-R EVO brakes are progressive and constant.\n• CRANKBROTHERS Synthesis Enduro wheels are made of aluminium. Their stiffness is different front and back to optimise Grip and manoeuvrability.\n• The SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain features a wide 10-52t gear ratio.",
